    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#webpage","url":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk","name":"Self-ordering kiosk for restaurants & fast food | Innovorder","description":"Optimize flows at your point of sale with the Innovorder ordering terminal. Increase your average basket size and streamline checkout.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#product"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.innovorder.com/en"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Self Ordering Kiosk","item":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk"}]},{"@type":"Product","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#product","name":"Innovorder self-ordering kiosk","description":"Comprehensive touchscreen ordering kiosk solution for the restaurant industry: boost your revenue, streamline peak hours, and enhance the customer experience. The price of an ordering kiosk typically ranges from €2,000 to €15,000, depending on the hardware, software, and services included.","brand":{"@type":"Brand","name":"Innovorder"},"manufacturer":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/#organization","name":"Innovorder","url":"https://www.innovorder.com/en"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.9","bestRating":"5","worstRating":"1","ratingCount":"550"},"offers":{"@type":"AggregateOffer","lowPrice":"2000","highPrice":"15000","priceCurrency":"EUR","offerCount":"1","url":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk","availability":"https://schema.org/InStock"},"additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Screen sizes","value":"15, 22 and 27 inches"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Formats","value":"Floor-standing, wall-mounted, countertop, on an articulated arm"},{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Languages","value":"French, English, Spanish, Italian, German"}]},{"@type":"SoftwareApplication","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#software","name":"Innovorder kiosk software","applicationCategory":"BusinessApplication","operatingSystem":"Proprietary","description":"Software interface for taking orders with intelligent suggestions and kitchen synchronization."},{"@type":"VideoObject","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#video","name":"How the Innovorder self-ordering kiosk works","description":"Video presentation of how Innovorder terminals work and their advantages for restaurant owners.","thumbnailUrl":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/hubfs/miniature-video-borne.jpg","uploadDate":"2024-01-01T08:00:00+01:00","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eswKjYV6SNs","contentUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eswKjYV6SNs"},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/self-ordering-kiosk#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a self-ordering kiosk cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The price of a self-service kiosk generally ranges from €2,000 to €15,000, depending on the hardware, software, and services included. The price depends in particular on the design, screen size, whether it includes a stand or a built-in card reader, as well as installation, training, maintenance, and shipping costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I install a self-ordering kiosk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our experts take care of everything. Whether in mainland France or the overseas departments and territories, our teams will come to your restaurant to install and set up the kiosk and train you on how to use it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why equip your restaurant with a self-ordering kiosk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The ordering kiosk saves time, boosts sales, and streamlines the checkout process. It makes it easier to customize orders and adjust menus based on inventory levels."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does an order terminal work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The ordering kiosk is equipped with a touchscreen and a payment terminal. Customers select their items using a menu layout tailored to your restaurant, pay by credit card, and the order is automatically sent to the kitchen."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a control unit be installed outdoors?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Depending on the layout of your restaurant, it is possible to install an Innovorder kiosk outdoors. Another option is to mount the kiosk on an articulated arm that can be extended outside through a window."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you choose an order terminal for your restaurant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The choice of a self-service kiosk depends on several factors: the layout of the location, the size of the store, sales goals, the customer journey, budget, design, and the desired level of customization. Consulting with an expert can help you identify the most suitable solution."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can you make the self-ordering kiosk easier to use in your restaurant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Assign an employee to assist customers, maintain a personal touch by explaining the benefits, and place the kiosks in a visible and accessible location near the entrance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many ordering terminals should you install in your restaurant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Up to 80 tickets per day: 1 kiosk. Between 80 and 160 tickets per day: 2 kiosks. More than 160 tickets per day: 3 or more kiosks. This estimate helps streamline service and reduce wait times."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I rent a kiosk for my restaurant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, leasing is a cost-effective option that helps preserve cash flow by avoiding a large upfront investment. It also offers the flexibility to adapt the equipment to your needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I create a product on the order terminal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Product management is handled through the Innovorder back office. Once you’re set up, we’ll train you on how to use it so you can independently add, edit, or delete items and adjust prices."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the advantages of a self-ordering kiosk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"An order kiosk helps improve the customer experience, reduce wait times, increase the average basket size through smart recommendations, and optimize staff scheduling."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the main criteria for choosing a self-ordering kiosk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The main consideration is how well it fits your space and customer flow: freestanding, wall-mounted, counter-mounted, or on an articulated arm."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How to choose the right restaurant ordering terminal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is important to consider several factors: available space, order volume, the desired customer experience, and integration with your point-of-sale software."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which cash register software should you choose for your kiosk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It is essential to choose compatible POS software to ensure smooth synchronization of orders and payments. Innovorder offers a comprehensive, integrated solution."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the terminal multilingual?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Innovorder kiosks are multilingual. Your ordering process and menus are available in five languages: French, English, Spanish, Italian, and German."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a loyalty program be integrated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Innovorder kiosks are compatible with popular loyalty programs, including Como, Hey Pongo, and Splio."}}]}]}</script>
    <style is:inline>

    	.volume-marquee__collection-wrapper {
        -webkit-animation: logoloop 90s linear infinite;
