                  </div>
                  <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                    <p class="tab_faq-text">Simplify the ordering process for your foreign customers and make your staff's work easier by offering a multilingual kiosk. Your order path and menus are available in five languages: French, English, Spanish, Italian and German.</p>
