        <h2 data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d2893785" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">The questions we are asked about our<span class="gradient-text"> order terminal:</span></h2>
        <div data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d2893789" class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d289378a-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d289378a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How much does a self-ordering kiosk cost?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The price of an ordering kiosk generally ranges from €2,000 to €15,000, depending on the hardware (screen, stand), software, and services included. The price depends in particular on the design, screen size, whether it has a stand or integrated payment terminal, as well as installation, training, maintenance, and transport costs.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d2893795-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d2893795" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I install a self-ordering kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our experts take care of everything! In France or in the overseas departments and territories, our teams will come to your restaurant to install and configure the terminal and train you in its use.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937a0-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937a0" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Why install a kiosk in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The ordering kiosk saves time, increases revenue, and streamlines checkout. It makes it easy to customize orders and adjust menus based on inventory.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937ab-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937ab" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does an order terminal work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The order terminal is equipped with a touch screen and a payment terminal. Customers select their products via a process tailored to your menu, pay by credit card, and the order is automatically sent to the kitchen.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937b6-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937b6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can a control unit be installed outdoors?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Depending on the configuration of your restaurant, it may be possible to install an Innovorder bollard outdoors. Another solution is to install the bollard on an articulated arm that can be deployed outdoors via a window.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937c1-6643cbaf" data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937c1" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you choose an order terminal for your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The choice of terminal depends on several criteria: location configuration, store size, sales objectives, customer journey, budget, design, and desired level of customization. Support from an expert can help identify the most suitable solution.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-eca944c7-e927-db18-f140-25ee0b443993-6643cbaf" data-w-id="eca944c7-e927-db18-f140-25ee0b443993" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How can you make it easier to use the order terminal in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>Designate an employee to assist customers and answer their questions.</li>
                <li>Keep the human touch by explaining to your customers that the order terminal allows them to choose and order their menu quickly and freely.</li>
                <li>Position the terminals in a visible and accessible location, ideally near the entrance, to streamline the ordering process.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-f6b7f5ed-b7a9-f2d7-47f5-087295c35895-6643cbaf" data-w-id="f6b7f5ed-b7a9-f2d7-47f5-087295c35895" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How many ordering terminals should you install in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Product management is done from the Innovorder back office. You can add, modify, or delete items, adjust prices, and organize your menu independently, without technical intervention.</div>
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>Up to 80 tickets per day: 1 terminal</li>
                <li>Between 80 and 160 tickets per day: 2 terminals</li>
                <li>More than 160 tickets per day: 3 or more terminals</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions _2">This estimate helps to streamline service and reduce waiting times for your customers.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7170691d-6a62-fc7b-0acf-3d4bb72e2764-6643cbaf" data-w-id="7170691d-6a62-fc7b-0acf-3d4bb72e2764" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I rent a kiosk for my restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, leasing kiosks is an advantageous option for restaurateurs. It preserves cash flow by avoiding a major initial investment, and offers the flexibility to adapt the equipment as your needs evolve.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7c8cc4cd-bc4f-e59e-4d75-0ff3db2e081b-6643cbaf" data-w-id="7c8cc4cd-bc4f-e59e-4d75-0ff3db2e081b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do I create a product on the order terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Products are managed via the Innovorder back-office. As soon as you are installed, we train you in its use so that you are 100% autonomous. You can then easily add, modify or delete items, adjust prices and organize your menu according to your preferences. This interface allows you to keep your offer up to date on your own, without the need for special technical assistance.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_1ca1858f-e83c-943b-b9de-338329bfd70a-6643cbaf" data-w-id="1ca1858f-e83c-943b-b9de-338329bfd70a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the advantages of a self-ordering kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Order kiosks improve the customer experience by reducing waiting times and streamlining the purchasing process. They increase the average basket thanks to intelligent suggestions, and optimize staff organization by limiting manual order-taking.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-cdf2d48e-e642-56b7-a851-1cfb278c2090-6643cbaf" data-w-id="cdf2d48e-e642-56b7-a851-1cfb278c2090" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What are the main criteria for choosing a self-ordering kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The main criterion is to match your space and customer flow. Depending on the size and layout of your restaurant, you can opt for a free-standing, wall-mounted, countertop or articulated arm kiosk.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_25f00759-1038-de3c-ae94-cc030ef2f29c-6643cbaf" data-w-id="25f00759-1038-de3c-ae94-cc030ef2f29c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How to choose the right restaurant ordering terminal?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's important to take several criteria into account: available space, order volume, desired customer experience and integration with your cash register software. Our experts can help you find the ideal solution.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_90420e75-3027-b630-0e8e-f18c1e766546-6643cbaf" data-w-id="90420e75-3027-b630-0e8e-f18c1e766546" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Which cash register software should you choose for your kiosk?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">It's essential to choose cash register software that's compatible with your order terminal, to ensure smooth synchronization of orders and payments. Innovorder offers a complete, integrated solution that adapts to your business.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_0080142e-2fcb-758b-1488-4cff47403547-6643cbaf" data-w-id="0080142e-2fcb-758b-1488-4cff47403547" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is the terminal multilingual?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our terminals are multilingual. Your order path and menus are available in five languages: French, English, Spanish, Italian and German.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_34c6a2fd-9742-d467-10e7-ccbcf7aca07b-6643cbaf" data-w-id="34c6a2fd-9742-d467-10e7-ccbcf7aca07b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I join a loyalty program?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, our kiosks are compatible with the best loyalty programs on the market, including Como, Hey Pongo and Splio, enabling customers to collect points and benefit from personalized offers.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_532d4105-e039-f35e-3188-661d019ce060-6643cbaf" data-w-id="532d4105-e039-f35e-3188-661d019ce060" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What sizes are the self-ordering kiosks available in?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our bollards are available in a range of sizes to suit any space:<br>- 15 inches: compact and unobtrusive<br>- 22 inches: standard size for optimum visibility<br>- 27 inches: ideal for establishments with high order volumes<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div><div class="section cta-kiosk">
      <div data-w-id="385c522c-6a18-b2e9-026d-ec58d28937cd" style="opacity:0" class="middle-section-wrapper">
